[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_03_0010","text":"辛苦了……！\n这场演出很棒！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_03_0020","text":"嗯\n适当地有"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_03_0030","text":"看来那些草莓没有白费啊\n哈哈哈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_03_0040","text":"嘛……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_03_0050","text":"怎么了？\n有什么不满意的地方吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_03_0060","text":"是啊——\n今天的表现，还不能让我满足，怎么说呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_03_0070","text":"所以呢，\n我还想再努力一下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_03_0080","text":"那个……这份心意我很感激\n但你说努力……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_03_0082","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_03_0090","text":"下次，带我去摘草莓吧——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_03_0100","text":"不不，\n演唱会都已经结束了啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30500200_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
